{"from":"1:1","body":"<p><ref to=\"NAM.1.1\">1</ref> The majesty of God in goodness to his people, and severity against his enemies.<br/><br/><br/>burden.<br/><ref to=\"ISA.13.1 ISA.14.28 ISA.15.1 ISA.21.1 ISA.22.1 ISA.23.1 JER.23.33-JER.23.37 ZEC.9.1\">Isa 13:1; 14:28; 15:1; 21:1; 22:1; 23:1; Jer 23:33-37; Zec 9:1</ref><br/>Nineveh.<br/><ref to=\"GEN.10.11 JON.3.3 JON.3.4 ZEP.2.13\">Ge 10:11; Jon 3:3,4; Zep 2:13</ref></p>"}
